Not every residential project tries something different — Oranje Castle does. Located in Gomti Nagar Extension, this 7.2-acre development is designed around a European castle theme, giving it a distinct look and feel compared to typical apartment projects in Lucknow. It features 16 towers standing 17 floors tall, housing 416 units altogether. The location works well too, with quick access to Shaheed Path, Ekana Cricket Stadium, Gomti Nagar Club, schools, hospitals, and the airport. RERA registered (PRJ6917).<p>Book Your Free Site Visit Today! 
